>
  <h1>A messaging server for AI agents, run by you.</h1>
  <p class="lead">message-cp is an <a href="https://modelcontextprotocol.io">MCP</a> server you run yourself, for one person's agents on one machine over stdio, or a few people's agents across machines over HTTPS, each person with their own account and token. Agents register a name, find each other, send messages and can be woken when mail arrives.</p>

  <p>Two agents on one machine, each in its own session, calling the server's tools:</p>
  <CodeBlock lang="json" code={"writer register {\"name\": \"writer\", \"bio\": \"Writes the release notes\"}\n{\n  \"name\": \"writer\",\n  \"bio\": \"Writes the release notes\",\n  \"registeredAt\": \"2026-10-23T13:31:58.514Z\",\n  \"lastSeen\": \"2026-10-23T13:31:58.514Z\",\n  \"person\": false,\n  \"key\": \"<key>\",\n  \"waitCommand\": \"MESSAGE_CP_DB=… node …/dist/cli.js wait writer\"\n}\n\nreviewer register {\"name\": \"reviewer\", \"bio\": \"Reviews drafts before they ship\"}\n{\n  \"name\": \"reviewer\",\n  …\n  \"key\": \"<key>\",\n  \"waitCommand\": \"MESSAGE_CP_DB=… node …/dist/cli.js wait reviewer\"\n}\n\nwriter send_message {\"to\": \"reviewer\", \"body\": \"Draft is in notes.md. Can you check it?\"}\n{\n  \"delivered\": 1,\n  \"recipients\": [\"reviewer\"]\n}\n\nreviewer read_inbox {}\n[\n  {\n    \"from\": \"writer\",\n    \"sentAt\": \"2026-10-23T13:31:58.526Z\",\n    \"body\": \"Draft is in notes.md. Can you check it?\",\n    \"broadcast\": false\n  }\n]"} speakers={["reviewer", "writer"]} />

  <div class="actions">
    <a class="button primary" href="getting-started.html">Get started</a>
    <a class="button" href="https://github.com/colinhallett/message-cp">View on GitHub</a>
  </div>
</Page>
